":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["莊公"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p008","quote":"莊公又娶宋雍氏女，生厲公突。雍氏有寵於宋。宋莊公聞祭仲之立忽，乃使人誘召祭仲而執之，曰：「不立突，將死。」亦執突以求賂焉。祭仲許宋，與宋盟。以突歸，立之。昭公忽聞祭仲以宋要立其弟突，九月（辛）［丁］亥，忽出奔衞。己亥，突至鄭，立，是爲厲公。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p008","text":"莊公又娶宋雍氏女，生厲公突。雍氏有寵於宋。宋莊公聞祭仲之立忽，乃使人誘召祭仲而執之，曰：「不立突，將死。」亦執突以求賂焉。祭仲許宋，與宋盟。以突歸，立之。昭公忽聞祭仲以宋要立其弟突，九月（辛）［丁］亥，忽出奔衞。己亥，突至鄭，立，是爲厲公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"宋雍氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"swf_ksm_2oo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"厲公突","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"雍氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"1cr_7o7_q01","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"63x_7fc_69z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"忽","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"祭仲","kind":"person","person_id":"63x_7fc_69z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"突","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m008-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"突","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er_B","status":"contex